# Inputs and outputs outside git: fetched sources (ref/), every build directory (build/).
# Nothing derived from the player's disc is ever committed, except native/data/initial_pipeline_cache.db:
# pipeline keys (GX state) recorded from runs of the game, no game data (docs/SWITCH_BUILD.md).
ref/
/build*/
cmake-build-*/

